<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Cell Biol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">jcb</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of Cell Biology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0021-9525</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-8140</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2064292</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">1774iti20070517c</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1083/jcb.1774iti20070517c</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Motoring microvillar membrane</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Powell</surname><given-names>Kendall</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>4</day><month>6</month><year>2007</year></pub-date><volume>177</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>941</fpage><lpage>941</lpage><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2007, The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2007</copyright-year><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:href="jcb1770941.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 177 No. 4, May 21, 2007. Page <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="177" page="566" id="N0x1d9cd20N0x1d5c800" ext-link-type="pmc">567</related-article>.</p><p>Due to an editorial error, in two instances, the original story incorrectly referred to myosin-1a as a microtubule motor. Myosin-1a is an actin-based motor.</p><p>The html and pdf versions of this article have been corrected. The error remains only in the print version.</p></body></article>